**Explain the remaining supplied mechanisms.**\
We have genuine formation and selection results, but particular constructions still supply sensing laws, calibration, assembly recipes, candidate families and inquiry priorities. Our latest learner, for example, forms a new reader under a specified recipe; it does not explain why that reliable recipe arises and gets selected. These dependencies must be traced through compatible derivations wherever the stronger account claims to explain them. Your strict no-assumptions requirement remains unmet.&#x20;

